, Piltz, and Ai are beset by another member of Amarariruku. She captures Ai, intent on delivering her to her sister, and wields the power of love against Shy and Piltz. Atop the tower, Mai waits for the long-awaited confrontation.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10563837/screencap/66bf1925b59bf.jpg"},{"title":"A Nice Guy","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18329","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"171748","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"57567","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"211709","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"425474","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"84762","synopsis":"Stardust confronts Stigma and Quabala alone, while Ai and Shy's confrontation with Mai takes a turn for the worst. Ai struggles to accept her sister's fall from grace, and Stardust receives a bone-chilling revelation from Stigma.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10563839/screencap/66c85695d2c77.jpg"},{"title":"Vague","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18329","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"171748","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"57567","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"211709","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"425474","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"84923","synopsis":"With the fusion of Ai and Mai into an entirely new being, Shy is left alone atop the tower to face a formidable foe alone. Hearts clash on battlefields both physical and emotional.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10563840/screencap/66d18acba90c9.jpg"},{"title":"Hand Reached Out","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber"